<title>FINLAND: TABLE - METSA-SERLA H1 PROFIT UP 37 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - METSA-SERLA H1 PROFIT UP 37 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   306 vs 223</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.32 vs 1.33</p>
<p> Net sales					  8,761 vs 7,427</p>
<p> Operating profit				   743 vs 492</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Metsa-Serla's H1 profit after financial items had been 269 million markka (range 163-310 million).  </p>
<p> Depreciation			   666 vs 541</p>
<p> Net exchange losses		  142 vs 91</p>
<p> Other financial items     charge 295 vs 178 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary income		 415 vs 122</p>
