<p> Profit before minorities, taxes  716 vs 313  Minorities		     charge 14 vs 4 gain</p>
<p> Taxes				    239 vs 95</p>
<p> Net profit			     463 vs 222</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (pct)    34.5 vs 35.8</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Metsa-Serla Oy.</p>
